+"{name} was left out of this build: {why}. It comes back when its author makes a version for this game.": "{name} 没进这次构建：{why}。等作者做出适配这个游戏的版本，它会回来。",
+"{opening} What each one sends is below it; the privacy page on playhorizon.dev says how long it is kept.": "{opening}每一项发送什么写在它下面；保留多久见 playhorizon.dev 的隐私页。",
+"{size}: its worlds, mods, packs and settings": "{size}：它的世界、模组、包和设置",
+"{step}: {ms} ms": "{step}：{ms} 毫秒",
