+    "Use a number from 1024 to 65535 (25565 is Minecraft's own).": "填 1024 到 65535 之间的数字（25565 是 Minecraft 的默认端口）。",
+    "What players see under the server's name (the MOTD).": "玩家在服务器名字下面看到的那行字（MOTD）。",
+    "When the game crashes: the error, where in Horizon's code it happened, your graphics adapter and settings. No log, no world or server, no user name in paths.":
+        "游戏崩溃时的信息：错误内容、出在 Horizon 代码的哪一处、你的显卡和设置。不含日志、不含存档或服务器、路径里也不含用户名。",
+    "While you play, the game sends an anonymous \"I'm playing\" ping once a minute, so the launcher can show how many people play Horizon right now. It holds: a random number made when the game starts and forgotten when it closes, the Horizon version, your OS (Linux, macOS or Windows), and whether you have a world open to LAN or friends. It doesn't hold: your account, your install ID, world or server names, or anything you do in the game, and the server doesn't keep your IP address. It is sent whatever the switches say.":
+        "游玩时，游戏每分钟发一次匿名的「正在游玩」心跳，让启动器能显示现在有多少人在玩 Horizon。"
+        "里面的内容：游戏启动时生成、关闭时丢弃的一个随机数，Horizon 版本，你的系统（Linux、macOS 或 Windows），以及你有没有开着局域网或好友联机。"
+        "不含：你的账户、安装 ID、存档或服务器名称、你在游戏里做的任何事；服务器也不保留你的 IP。这一项不受上面那些开关影响，始终发送。",
+    "You're offline. You can still change what you wear: it saves on this computer and syncs when you're back online.":
+        "你现在离线。照样能换装扮：先存在这台电脑上，联网后自动同步。",
+    "Your selected version only changes if you were playing the newest one.":
+        "只有当你之前玩的是最新版本时，选中的版本才会跟着更新。",
+    "Your Wardrobe session ended. Open the Wardrobe again.": "衣柜的连接断了，重新打开衣柜。",
+    "System follows your computer's language: {language} here. A string not translated yet shows in English.":
+        "「跟随系统」会使用电脑的语言：这里是 {language}。还没翻译的文字会显示英文。",
+    "{file} is on your desktop: it plays {name}.": "{file} 已在桌面上，双击就能玩 {name}。",
+    "{path} already exists. Move it away, or build into another folder.": "{path} 已经存在。把它挪开，或者构建到别的文件夹。",
+    "{program} is not installed here (or not on the PATH): copy the config instead.":
+        "{program} 没有装在这里（或不在 PATH 里）：改为手动复制配置。",
+    "{tag} is older than {newest}, which is installed: installing it as a rollback. The selection only moves to it when you pick it.":
+        "{tag} 比已安装的 {newest} 旧，会作为回滚版本装上。只有你自己选它时，当前选择才会切过去。",
+    "{version} from Horizon's registry, its own profile: {mods}":
+        "来自 Horizon 注册表的 {version}，有自己独立的配置：{mods}",
+    "A new version is available": "有新版本",
+    "Another account operation is running. Try again in a moment.": "另一个账户操作正在进行，稍等一下再试。",
+    "Check Minecraft: Java Edition ownership and your profile at minecraft.net.":
+        "在 minecraft.net 上检查你是否拥有 Minecraft: Java Edition，以及你的档案。",
+    "Horizon never turns on Funnel: the server isn't put on the public internet, only shared with the people you invite.":
+        "Horizon 不会打开 Funnel：服务器不会暴露到公网，只共享给你邀请的人。",
+    "Horizon runs a data pack's functions, function tags, predicates, item modifiers, recipes, loot tables, advancements, villager trades, damage types, most tags and most worldgen (biomes, features, structures, dimensions). Other files, such as world presets, are not read yet.":
+        "Horizon 会执行数据包里的函数、函数标签、谓词、物品修饰器、配方、战利品表、进度、村民交易、伤害类型、大部分标签，以及大部分世界生成（生物群系、地物、结构、维度）。"
+        "像世界预设这样的其他文件暂时还不会读取。",
+    "Its mods made for Minecraft {from} stay in its folder; some may not load in {to}.":
+        "它为 Minecraft {from} 做的模组会留在原文件夹里，其中一些在 {to} 里可能加载不了。",
+    "Its worlds were saved by Minecraft {from}: {to} upgrades them for good, and can't open them if it is older.":
+        "它的存档是用 Minecraft {from} 存的：{to} 会永久升级它们；如果 {to} 更旧，就打不开。",
+    "No version matches “{search}”.": "没有与「{search}」匹配的版本。",
+    "Nothing matches “{query}”.": "没有与「{query}」匹配的内容。",
+}
+
+# 全局替换：机械但对的东西，只动值。
+# 「您」：Minecraft 的中文一直用「你」，混着用像公文。
+GLOBAL = [("您", "你")]
+
+# cosmetics 一律是「装扮」，但 `decoration`（模组分类）本来就是「装饰」，不能一起改。
+COSMETICS_KEYS = [
+    "Could not reach Horizon's cosmetics service. Check your internet connection.",
+    "Hide other players' cosmetics",
+    "Horizon's cosmetics service had a problem. Try again later.",
+    "Off: everyone sees you without them.",
+    "Other players see you without your cosmetics.",
+    "Other players see your cosmetics again.",
+    "Show my cosmetics",
+    "Sign in to use cosmetics.",
+    "You don't own any cosmetics yet.",
+]
+
+# profile 是「独立的游戏配置」，不是 .cfg 那种「配置文件」。
+PROFILE_KEYS = [
+    "Installed {pack} {version} as its own profile with {mods}, each checked. Play it from the list above.",
+]
+
+# 半角标点，只在中文旁边时替换。
+HALF = {",": "，", ":": "：", ";": "；", "!": "！", "?": "？"}
+
+
+def halfwidth_to_full(text: str) -> str:
+    out = list(text)
+    for i, ch in enumerate(out):
+        if ch in HALF:
+            before = out[i - 1] if i else ""
+            after = out[i + 1] if i + 1 < len(out) else ""
+            if before and after and ("\u4e00" <= before <= "\u9fff") and ("\u4e00" <= after <= "\u9fff"):
+                out[i] = HALF[ch]
+    return "".join(out)
+
+
+def main() -> int:
+    table = json.loads(LANG.read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
+
+    unknown = [key for key in FIXES if key not in table]
+    if unknown:
+        print(f"这些键不在表里（写错了？）：{len(unknown)} 条")
+        for key in unknown[:10]:
+            print(f"  {key[:100]!r}")
+        return 1
+
+    changed = 0
+    for key, value in FIXES.items():
+        if table[key] != value:
+            table[key] = value
+            changed += 1
+
+    for key in COSMETICS_KEYS:
+        if key in table and "装饰" in table[key]:
+            table[key] = table[key].replace("装饰", "装扮")
+            changed += 1
+
+    for key in PROFILE_KEYS:
+        if key in table and "配置文件" in table[key]:
+            table[key] = table[key].replace("配置文件", "独立配置")
+            changed += 1
+
+    # 「您」和半角标点：只动值。
+    for key, value in list(table.items()):
+        new = value
+        for old, replacement in GLOBAL:
+            if old in new:
+                new = new.replace(old, replacement)
+        new = halfwidth_to_full(new)
+        if new != value:
+            table[key] = new
+            changed += 1
+
+    print(f"逐条改写：{len(FIXES)} 条在表内；实际改动 {changed} 条")
+    if "--write" not in sys.argv:
+        print("只报告，未写入（加 --write）")
+        return 0
+    LANG.write_text(json.dumps(table, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + "\n", encoding="utf-8")
+    print(f"已写入 {LANG.name}：{len(table)} 条")
+    return 0
+
+
+if __name__ == "__main__":
+    sys.exit(main())
